{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "gr-this-that",
  "connector": "this / that",
  "gloss": "これ・それ・あれ",
  "title": "this, that, these, those — これ・それ・あれ",
  "pattern": "this（近く・1つ）/ that（離れた所・1つ）/ these（近く・複数）/ those（離れた所・複数）",
  "explanation": "近くのものは this（複数なら these）、離れたものは that（複数なら those）。名詞の前にも置けます：this one（これ）、that shop（あの店）、these shoes（この靴）。日本語の「それ」と「あれ」は、どちらも that です。",
  "natural": "お店で指さしながら：Can I have this one?（これをください）、How much are these?（これはいくらですか）。",
  "stiff": "these・those の後の名詞は複数形にします：these shoe ではなく these shoes。be動詞も are です（These are…）。",
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "gx-this-that-1",
      "english": "This is my friend, Ken.",
      "japanese": "こちらは友だちのケンです。",
      "chunks": [
        {
          "t": "This ",
          "w": "w-this"
        },
        {
          "t": "is my friend, ",
          "w": "w-friend"
        },
        {
          "t": "Ken."
        }
      ],
      "gap": {
        "before": "",
        "answer": "This",
        "after": " is my friend, Ken.",
        "options": [
          "This",
          "These",
          "Those"
        ],
        "why": "人を紹介する時は This is…（こちらは〜）。1人なので this。"
      },
      "audio": "audio/en/grammar/gx-this-that-1.mp3",
      "tags": [
        "文法",
        "this / that"
      ],
      "difficulty": 1
    },
